Required decisions:

1. open-source, source-available, or proprietary distribution;
2. copyright holder/legal entity and applicable years;
3. treatment of third-party assets, AI model weights, icons, and generated code;
4. contribution terms;
5. compatibility with MediaPipe, Gemma model licensing, and all dependency
